## Workflow

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A[Doctor] --> B[Hospital EMR]
    B --> C[Drug Interaction Service]

    C --> D[Drug Database]
    C --> E[AI Model]

    D --> F[Risk Evaluation]
    E --> F

    F --> G{AI Confident?}

    G -->|Yes| H[Display Recommendation]
    G -->|No / Uncertain| I[Alert Doctor or Pharmacist]

    H --> J[Doctor Dashboard]
    I --> K[Human Review]

    K --> J
```
